<title>INDIA: India L&amp;T Q1 97/98 sales up 23 pct.</title>
<headline>India L&amp;T Q1 97/98 sales up 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering and construction giant Larsen  &amp; Toubro Ltd said on Friday its sales rose 23 percent to 12.69 billion  rupees in the first quarter of 1997/98 (April-March) from 10.32 billion  in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
